
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <meta name="description" content="Éclat Reborn — 高端二手水晶回收與估價。精緻工藝標準、透明流程、即時回應。">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/styles.css">
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27 viewBox=%270 0 100 100%27%3E%3Ctext y=%27.82em%27 font-size=%2782%27%3E%F0%9F%92%8E%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="nav-wrap">
    <div class="nav">
      <a class="logo" href="#top" aria-label="Éclat Reborn">
        <svg width="120" height="28" viewBox="0 0 120 28" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-hidden="true">
          <text x="0" y="20" font-family="Playfair Display, serif" font-size="20" fill="#0d1b1e">Éclat</text>
          <text x="54" y="20" font-family="Inter, system-ui" font-size="16" fill="#2f4a4f">Reborn</text>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <nav class="links">
        <a href="#how-it-works">流程</a>
        <a href="#get-offer">估價</a>
        <a href="#faqs">FAQ</a>
        <a href="#contact">聯絡</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="top">
    <%- body %>
  </main>

  <footer id="contact" class="site-foot">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="foot-columns">
        <div>
          <div class="wordmark">Éclat Reborn</div>
          <p class="muted">高端二手水晶回收與估價服務｜參考價以系統估值，最終以專員檢驗為準。</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>聯絡</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>WhatsApp / 電話：+852 9xxxxxxx</li>
            <li>Email：hello@eclatreborn.example</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>資訊</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>回收條款與細則</li>
            <li>私隱政策</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="copy">© <span id="y"></span> Éclat Reborn</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>document.getElementById('y').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();</script>
  <script src="/public/js/pricing.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
